'''Icey''' is a [[Pets|godly]] pet that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Frostbite Item Pack]] for 1,699 Robux during the [[Christmas Event 2019|2019 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

== Appearance ==
It resembles a dark purple dragon with icey features, hence the name. The horns, eyes, nostrils, fangs, and claws are all made out of ice, contrasting from its wings and body being dark purple.

